  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0a1772e3-5c11-4443-b0de-23545306c64f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>這是一個支援包，用於將 Sophisticated 系列模組的材質調整為與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 相同的中世紀風格。</p>\n<p><strong>支援的模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><em>Sophisticated Core</em></strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><em>Sophisticated Backpacks</em></strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><em>Sophisticated Storage</em></strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">注意：請忽略此資源包的格式不相容警告。這是因為資源包格式值導致的，對於此特定資源包而言並不重要。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>功能特色：</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有 GUI 界面的重繪</strong></li>\n<li><strong>所有圖標的重繪</strong></li>\n<li><strong>所有箱子、桶和限定版桶的重繪</strong></li>\n<li><strong>所有背包和儲存升級模組的重繪</strong></li>\n<li><strong>部分隨機物品的重繪</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>展示：</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e0b8e7e1-99e9-4839-a718-7135b768c290.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"749\" height=\"845\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_700b76cd-38d7-4429-bba9-4f7b0310babd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_18d6780a-73a7-4b96-8126-09471f19aea1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>致謝：</strong></h2>\n<p>Maffhew - 資源包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 的作者</p>\n<p>P3pp3rF1y - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Core</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage</a> 的作者</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>獲取渠道：</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/krebton/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1532823/description_25076315-d683-4d08-acbf-ee95582e878d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKrebton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1532823/description_d8c3d4b7-a73d-4e89-b092-3c0a3a74128b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p>",
